cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these proofs, certificates or checkers, please cite them. Concept DOI (all versions): 10.5281/zenodo.24191316; v0.1.0: 10.5281/zenodo.24191317; v0.2.0: 10.5281/zenodo.24195467; v0.3.0: 10.5281/zenodo.24223156. In v1.0.0 the nineteen two-piece results are formally verified in Lean 4 (kernel-checked, standard axioms only; the claims are stated in lean/PackLean/Formal/Spec.lean). Everything else (the results for three or more pieces and the exact algebraic values of the six two-piece enclosures) is computer-assisted, not a formal proof."
title: "packing-optimality-certificates: optimality proofs for packing unit Platonic solids into a Platonic container"
authors:
  - family-names: Nakano
    given-names: Hirotaka
repository-code: "https://github.com/konoha-ily2/packing-optimality-certificates"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24191316
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
